              "Produces ATP (adenosine triphosphate)",
              "Produces NADPH (nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate)"
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "B. Light-Independent Reactions (Calvin Cycle in Stroma)",
            "details": [
              "Fixes CO2 (carbon dioxide): converts inorganic carbon to organic compounds"
