{"context": "W=F·s cos θ. K=½mv². P=W/t. Conservative force: path-independent work. ΔU=-W_conservative.

Torque τ=rF sin θ. τ=Iα. Parallel axis: I=I_cm+Md².

Ohm's law V=IR. Resistivity ρ=RA/l. Series R_eq=R1+R2. Parallel 1/R_eq=1/R1+1/R2. Kirchhoff junction: sum I_in = sum I_out. Drift velocity v_d; I=neAv_d.", "selected_source_count": 3}

