      "question": "Most nutrient absorption occurs in:",
      "options": [
        "Stomach",
        "Oesophagus",
        "Small intestine villi",
        "Mouth"
      ],
      "correct_answer": "Small intestine villi",
      "explanation": "Villi absorb digested nutrients."
    }
  ]
}"}

