        "**DNA's structure** (double helix, A-T/G-C pairing) provides a stable, inheritable blueprint.",
        "**Semiconservative replication** ensures accurate transmission of genetic information across generations.",
        "**mRNA** bridges the gap between DNA's code and the production of functional proteins.",
