            "**Hydrochloric acid (HCl)** denatures proteins and activates pepsinogen.",
            "**Pepsin**, a protease, is secreted as inactive pepsinogen and activated by HCl.",
            "Pepsin breaks down **proteins** into proteoses and peptones."
        ]
    },
